- **Peer auth blocks `psql -U postgres`** from the `scottw` account, and `sudo`
  needs interactive auth. Use the wallet-backed `grafana_app` env file instead of
  trying to become the superuser.
- **Grafana provisions on a 30 s poll**, so dashboard/datasource changes are not
  visible instantly. Wait, then re-check `dashboard` and `data_source`.

